+    )
+    add("")
+    out.extend(d3_table())
+    add("")
+    add(
+        f"Against the reference-geometry partition at the same N, SEALED changes in {sealed_geo[0]} of {sealed_geo[1]} grid-by-N comparisons and MARGIN changes in {margin_geo[0]} of {margin_geo[1]}. "
+        f"Across the grid and N sweep, SEALED uses {sealed_geo[2]}..{sealed_geo[3]} active beams and MARGIN uses {margin_geo[2]}..{margin_geo[3]}; singleton populations force the lower endpoint. Therefore the optimum is not geometry-invariant. At N=24 specifically, both the number of beams and their occupancies change across the grid. Off-axis and range are decision-relevant here through PA/fixed-cost scaling and cap feasibility, even without interference."
+    )
+    add("")
+    add("## D4 — zero fixed-cost discriminator")
+    add("")
+    add("Here both 0.338 W active-chain cost and 0.200 W active-satellite baseband cost are set to zero only inside the diagnostic optimizer; all RF, ACM, cap, and PA laws remain unchanged.")
+    add("")
+    out.extend(d4_table())
+    add("")
+    add(
+        f"The interior optimum survives. At N=24, SEALED changes from `{partition_text(sealed_n24.partition)}` to `{partition_text(sealed_zero_n24.partition)}`, and MARGIN changes from `{partition_text(margin_n24.partition)}` to `{partition_text(margin_zero_n24.partition)}`; neither becomes one beam or 24 singleton beams. The zero-fixed-cost partitions are identical between SEALED and MARGIN because MARGIN multiplies every feasible RF requirement by the same 1/q10 at fixed elevation, and the square-root PA law therefore multiplies every beam's supply by the same `1/sqrt(q10)`. The discriminator says the interior is driven by discrete mode/capacity thresholds plus the PA law; fixed costs shift the selected mix but do not create the interior."
+    )
+    add("")
+    add("## Reproduction")
+    add("")
+    add("From `/home/sat/mcrl-v025-arch-ws`:")
+    add("")
+    add("```bash")
+    add("nice -n 15 env PYTHONPATH=src /home/sat/mcrl-leo-handover/.venv/bin/python scripts/run_occupancy_convexity.py")
+    add("```")
+    add("")
+    add("The program prints this report. It imports the production ACM, antenna/noise, nominal-path, PA-supply, and authenticated q10 functions; exhaustive integer partition enumeration is local diagnostic logic. No sealed artifact is modified.")
+    print("\n".join(out))
