+    )
+    add("")
+    add("## D2 — efficiency-optimal partition, N=1..24")
+    add("")
+    add(
+        "For partition occupancies `(n1,...,nk)`, delivered rate is `sum_b B*eta_mode(nb)` and power is `sum_b(P_PA(p_req(nb))+0.338)+0.200` W. All beams are packed on one active satellite, because no per-satellite beam ceiling is declared and this is the energy-minimizing placement. Infeasible occupancies (uncapped RF above 1.65 W or no ACM mode) are excluded because all N users must be served. EE is delivered bit/s divided by watts, i.e. bit/J."
+    )
+    add("")
+    out.extend(d2_table())
+    add("")
+    add(
